["Muscle spindle; carried by Group Ia sensory afferent fibers", "Golgi tendon organ; carried by Group Ib sensory afferent fibers", "Pacinian corpuscle; carried by Group II sensory afferent fibers", "Meissner corpuscle; carried by Group A-beta fibers", "Free nerve ending; carried by Group C fibers"],
